WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:02.550
I'm trying to make it
feel familiar,

2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.582
with as little for her
to figure out as possible.

3
00:00:07.221 --> 00:00:09.550
I know other families are
facing similar challenges,

4
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.462
and I hope what I'm building
can eventually help them too.

5
00:00:15.199 --> 00:00:18.725
I'll be sharing what I try
and what I learn as I go.

6
00:00:19.776 --> 00:00:22.550
In the meantime, if someone
in your family

7
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:25.190
is finding it hard to stay
in touch with loved ones,

8
00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:26.800
please send me a message.

9
00:00:27.464 --> 00:00:29.292
I'd love to see if
HelloPorch can help.
